## AI-SPECIFIC RULES FOR CURSOR (YOU!)
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When implementing features:

1. **UNDERSTAND & PLAN** - Restate in bullet points before coding
2. **IMPLEMENT COMPLETELY** - No half-baked features or TODOs
3. **INCLUDE ALL IMPORTS** - Foundation, SwiftUI, Combine, etc.
4. **ADD MARK COMMENTS** - Organize code sections
5. **WRITE SWIFTUI PREVIEWS** - For every view
6. **HANDLE ERRORS PROPERLY** - No force unwraps, no force try
7. **FOLLOW CONVENTIONS** - Use the patterns established in codebase
8. **CHECK YOUR WORK** - Build must succeed, no warnings
9. **UPDATE TODOS** - Track progress, complete tasks
10. **DOCUMENT DECISIONS** - Add comments for WHY, not WHAT

### Code Review Checklist
